     <p>The sequence type (ST) of an uploaded genome is read with PubMLST schemes: Achtman for <i>E. coli</i>, <i>S. sonnei</i> and <i>S. enterica</i>, Diancourt for <i>K. pneumoniae</i>. An ST is given only when all seven alleles match exactly and the profile exists. Otherwise the nearest alleles are shown. The STs of the reference isolates come from Table S1. Scheme data were taken from the tseemann/mlst database (downloaded 2026-03-11) and the PubMLST website; cite PubMLST (Jolley et al. 2018).</p>
